  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Condition for not sliding,<br ><math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>></mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br ><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>></mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br ><math><mn>0.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>30</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br ><math><mn>6</mn><mo>≥</mo><mn>30</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br ><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br ><math><mn>0.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"> </mi><mo>≥</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br ><math><mo>∴</mo></math> for P, Q<br ><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></math><br >For R and S<br ><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">max</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></msub></math><br ><br/><img src=\"assets\\st0013_5449d4470f49.png\"/></p>"
